{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PPRx2SKTCt5fK1wZJp5KSp","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 02: Theme toggle control\n2\t\n3\t**Blocked by:** 01\n4\t**Status:** ready-for-agent\n5\t\n6\tAdd Light/Dark overrides that save to the profile and apply instantly, sync across devices, revert on save errors, and meet WCAG AA contrast.\n7\t\n8\t## Acceptance Criteria\n9\t- [ ] Choosing Light or Dark applies immediately, persists across logout/login and devices, and reverts with an error message if the save fails.\n10\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbb2","uuid":"59f3ef36-7ed3-45a7-b401-f362e9750958","timestamp":"2026-09-24T02:41:46.542Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"«WORKING_AREA»/issues/02-theme-toggle-control.md","content":"# 02: Theme toggle control\n\n**Blocked by:** 01\n**Status:** ready-for-agent\n\nAdd Light/Dark overrides that save to the profile and apply instantly, sync across devices, revert on save errors, and meet WCAG AA contrast.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Choosing Light or Dark applies immediately, persists across logout/login and devices, and reverts with an error message if the save fails.\n","numLines":10,"startLine":1,"totalLines":10}}}
